<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ICA raised to outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ICA raised to outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co said on Friday it was raising its rating for Mexico's Empresas ICA Sociedad Controladora SA de CV to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Oppenheimer said the upgrade was &quot;based on our expectation of 10-15 percent EBITDA growth through 1999 from increased Mexican and international construction activity.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
